SUMMARY:Roller Skating Hang Out - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nJoi
 n us for an hour or two of roller skating indoors at the Florham Park Roll
 er Rink\, 192 Ridgedale Ave. No experience is needed. All you have to do i
 s show up! Come anytime. Open skate is scheduled from 1 p.m. until 3 p.m.\
 n\nThe cost is $16 per person\, unless you happen to have your own skates.
  Then\, it's $10! You walk inside\, pay at the window on your own\, and th
 en you'll see a growing group of people around one of the first sets of ta
 bles likely between 12:50 and 1:20 p.m. Some parking is available on site.
 \n\nIf looking to learn more\, here's the website link for the roller rink
  -> www.myrink.com.\n\n\\*\\*\\* We will likely hang out after skating at 
 the Florham Park Diner\, 182 Ridgedale Ave. Feel free to post your ideas b
 elow in the comments section. Last time\, we went to a place called Recess
 \, a bar with pool tables\, shuffleboard\, a dart board and video games in
  Parsippany\, thanks to a suggestion from Nigel. \\*\\*\\*\n\nQuestions? S
 uggestions? Concerns? You can message me on Meetup or WhatsApp\, or call/t
 ext me at 201-234-9609. Or feel free to comment below.\n\nThis event idea 
 comes to you courtesy of Joe\, one of our many regulars. Hope you'll consi
 der attending our 7th skating event\, or joining us for a bowling\, volley
 ball\, tennis or other event -> www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer
 -volleyball
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/313269115/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260208T201638Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260208T201638Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
