DESCRIPTION:🎉 Meet the Greeks – April 20 | 1–4 PM | The Quad 🎉\nCurious 
 about Greek life? Come out to our Meet the Greeks tabling event on April 
 20th from 1–4 PM in the Quad!\nThis is your chance to connect with member
 s from our campus’ fraternities and sororities\, learn about their values
 \, philanthropy\, leadership opportunities\, and events\, and discover ho
 w Greek life can enhance your college experience. Whether you’re consider
 ing joining or just want to explore what each organization is about\, thi
 s event is open to everyone.\nStop by the tables\, ask questions\, grab s
 ome giveaways\, and find the community that feels like home. \nFREE Ice c
 ream tickets are first come\, first serve.\nStop by "Pie a President" and
  pie some of our Greek Leaders to donate to the Red Hawk Pantry. \nWe can
 ’t wait to meet you!\n \n\nHosted by: Greek Council\, Greek Life\n\nAddit
 ional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engag
 e/event/12433916
