DESCRIPTION: \n\n\nVisiting the Pantry:\n1) Please have your Event Pass\, 
 CWID and have a PantrySoft Registration. 2) Please bring your own shoppin
 g bag and ID card!***Visitors are allowed to come once/week***\nOur Missi
 on:  We aim to address food insecurity across Montclair State University.
  The Red Hawk Pantry is open to all students\, staff\, faculty\, and Alum
 ni at no cost. If you are unable to visit during our regular hours\, plea
 se reach out via email at redhawkpantry@montclair.eduStay updated by foll
 owing us on Instagram: @montclair_redhawkpantry\n \n🍎 Fall 2025 Hours\n\
