SUMMARY:NJ Death Cafe
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Death Cafe. This facilitated gathering allows for our community to come together to talk openly and honestly about life and death over refreshments. This is an open space to explore personal thoughts and feelings about death\, ultimately helping people to live fuller lives. Participants are encouraged to share\, listen\, and contemplate mortality in a safe\, confidential\, and nonjudgmental environment. Everyone is welcome—all identities\, experiences\, and beliefs. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/nj-death-cafe-8/
LOCATION:Cornerstone Montclair\, 198 Bellvue Ave.\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="NJ Death Cafe":MAILTO:deathcafenj@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
