 a place for students\, vendors\, small business owners\, and sustainabili
 ty heroes to buy\, sell\, create\, and connect. This Earth Day\, we are b
 ringing circular fashion to Montclair. Vendors will be selling second-han
 d clothes\, handmade accessories\, plants\, and more!\n\nHosted by: Montc
