DESCRIPTION:This is a judgement free group & space for all male and male i
 dentifying students\, and is all about open\, real conversations about wh
 at it means to be a man today. We’ll get into topics like relationships\,
  communication\, respect\, masculinity\, and handling pressure—without th
 e filters or expectations. It’s a space to be honest\, challenge each oth
 er\, and grow—whether that means learning how to show up better in relati
 onships\, understanding boundaries and consent\, or just talking about th
 ings guys don’t usually get to say out loud. All are welcome!\n\nHosted b
 y: Advocacy and Outreach\, Bloomfield CAPS \, Bloomfield's Office of Resi
 dence Life\, University Police Department\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12435990
