 n with fire pits\, s’mores\, lawn games\, and tasty BBQ food fueling the 
 night. The highlight? LIVE MUSIC brings the energy\, setting the mood\, a
 nd turning the lawn into the ultimate hangout spot. Stop by the Sunset So
 cial and end the year with a bang.\n \nIf you’re an MSU student and music
 ian\, please sign up to perform at the Sunset Social via this form.\n \nH
 ow do I sign-up?\n\nNo registration required\nFREE for students with a va
 lid Montclair State ID\n\nWhen & Where:\n\nSaturday\, April 25\, 2026\n6:
 30-8:30 p.m.\nStudent Center Quad (rain location: SC Ballrooms)\n\n\nHost
 ed by: Campus Recreation\, EATS by Gourmet Dining\, Parent & Family Progr
 ams \, WMSC 90.3 FM\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://mo
 ntclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12267558
