 st keep your pet on leash for the entire hike and clean up after them.**\n
 \nLeader: Lou Nocito 973-953-7099\n\n\\*\\*\\* In registering for this or 
 any other South Mountain Conservancy (SMC) programs in 2026 online\, I her
