DESCRIPTION:<p><span>The Green Team invites you to participate in EarthWee
 k activities during this season of renewal.  </span></p><p><u><strong><s
 pan>Wednesday\, April 22: 7-9 pm in the Guild Room*</span></strong></u></p
 ><p><span>"The Little Things That Turn the World": a video about insects\,
  their current situation and what is being done to remedy it.</span></p><p
 ><u><strong><span>Sunday\, April 26: 12:15pm EarthFest Montclair </span><
 /strong></u></p><p><span>Join the Green Team after Coffee Hour (about 12:1
 5pm) to walk over to EarthFest on South Park.  Meet in the parking lot.</
 span></p><p><u><strong><span>Sunday\, April 26: 4:30-6 pm "The Light Won't
  Dim"*</span></strong></u></p><p><span>Guild Room.  A video about solar e
 nergy and the independence it provides.  Discussion around portable solar
 .</span></p><p><em><span>*Use the back door (and up the steps) from the pa
 rking lot off The Crescent.</span></em></p><p><a target="_blank" href="htt
 ps://fccmontclair.org/mt-content/uploads/2026/04/earthweek-activities-2026
 -pdf.pdf"><span><u>CLICK HERE for details</u> ...and to see other nearby
  Earthweek events. </span></a></p>
