SUMMARY:Teen Book Bedazzling (Ages 12 - 18)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Teen Book Bedazzling! We'll provide all the gem 
 supplies -- you just need to bring a copy of your favorite book (in good 
 condition\, without visible wear on the cover) and make it 
 fancy!\nRegistration required.\n\n\nPhoto credit: Maxie Elise\n\nYou can 
 learn more about Book Bedazzling and see samples here.\nThis event is 
 happening at the Bellevue Avenue Branch (185 Bellevue Ave). You can 
 register for Teen Book Bedazzling @ Main HERE. You are more than welcome to 
 attend both sessions!
