SUMMARY:Introduction to iPhone Videography
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nUnlock the power of your iPhone to create high-quality video 
 content in this hands-on\, two-part workshop designed for adult learners. 
 In the first session\, you'll learn practical tips and techniques for 
 shooting professional-looking video using just your phone—no fancy gear 
 required. The second session will guide you through the basics of editing 
 and producing your footage\, helping you turn raw clips into polished\, 
 shareable media. Perfect for beginners and anyone looking to tell their 
 story through video!\n\nStudents must have an iPhone to take this course. 
 They must have ample storage space on their iPhones for filming and must 
 know their Google login information ahead of time.\n
