SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nI'm
  Mike and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then w
 e'll break up into teams. At some point we'll make our own teams and get c
 ompetitive where you must serve to score! Games will be to 25.\nOutdoor ha
 rd court.\nWe may be going to Tropical Juice Bar afterwards at 60 River St
 . in Hackensack.\nThere's no fee to play volleyball and nothing else you n
 eed to do besides show up\, maybe bring a ball.\nIt's not on 41 Willow Tre
 e Road\, Leonia\, NJ.\nThe court is open to the public and if it happens t
 o be taken\, we may play with those already occupying it or we will reloca
 te to the grass since we have our own Volleyball NET!\nIf it's looking lik
 e it'll rain\, I'll make a call on whether to cancel.\nIf you have fun and
  would like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[Volleyball at 
 Overpeck Park in Leonia at 1pm to 6pm | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com
 /events/1146611264224277?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A[%7B%22m
 echanism%22%3A%22surface%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22groups_highlight_units%22
 %7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D)\nJoin our goup at [V for Volleyball
  New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
