SUMMARY:Randy Pressgrove's "This Car Sux!"
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T160000
UID:d5d06c6106948b63ec4ee0b90d0fb00d@eventbrite.com
DESCRIPTION:With a 40+ year career in automotive sales\, Pressgrove brings
