 nyurl.com/UUCMCardGames2526</a> </p><p>Meeting once monthly on 1st Wedne
 sdays in the Rotunda at the Unitarian Universalist Congregation at Montcla
 ir.</p><p>High school Youth through folks from the "Greatest Generation" a
