SUMMARY:The Searcher's Bible Study - Thursdays 7pm on Zoom
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260604T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260604T200000
DTSTAMP:20260418T030702Z
UID:99365vs466s8le45pm9ncap089_R20251002T230000@google.com__20260604
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20250121T153136Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Led by FCC member and ordained pastor\, Rev. Victor Pete
